{"seq":3,"slug":"diverse-appraisals","title":"多元评价","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/controversies-and-appraisal/diverse-appraisals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"admirers-and-critics","title":"崇拜者与批评者","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/controversies-and-appraisal/diverse-appraisals/admirers-and-critics","wordCount":1579,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"historical-assessment","title":"历史地位的评判","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/controversies-and-appraisal/diverse-appraisals/historical-assessment","wordCount":1688,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"多元评价\">多元评价</h1><p>对巴菲特的评价虽总体正面，仍有多元的声音。本章呈现这些声音并给出历史定位。</p>\n<p>第一篇文档讲述&quot;崇拜者与批评者&quot;——高度推崇与清醒审视两种声音的并存与价值。第二篇文档讲述&quot;历史地位的评判&quot;,在历史尺度上审视他作为最伟大投资家与道德典范的崇高地位。</p>\n"}